{"website_name is not included in untrusted_attributes macro and uses include_website_name method without trailing '?' which deviates from established pattern for gating sensitive fields": 0.48471924662590027, "Href uses user-provided URL without schema validation - user profile rendering binds href to model.website allowing javascript: URLs which could cause XSS when clicked": 0.14271856844425201, "UserSerializer exposes website_name field with full URL path to TL0/anonymous users, potentially leaking internal routing structure and user data": 0.3720703721046448, "Removal of client-side computed property websiteName without ensuring full parity in model/serializer could cause UI inconsistencies if website_name is not consistently available across all serializers or scopes": 0.11686117202043533, "Access-control gating around website_name and untrusted attributes may be inconsistent - if gating logic is misaligned with internal policy, sensitive fields could be exposed or omitted inconsistently": 0.3341948091983795, "URL/domain decision logic relies on Discourse.current_hostname which is a core environmental dependency that could affect website_name values across multisite setups": 0.11587182432413101, "Tests for website_name behavior are tightly coupled to hostname stubs and exact string assertions which can lead to flaky tests in different environments or when URL parsing changes": 0.021895987913012505, "No CHANGELOG entry documenting the new website_name exposure in the user serializer": 0.008418838493525982, "PR description is minimal and does not summarize the change, rationale, or security/privacy implications": 0.0062149870209395885, "No documentation explaining the new website_name field or its privacy implications": 0.0113803306594491, "Inline comments indicate property rename from websiteName to profileBackground but may not be in sync with runtime behavior": 0.25111645460128784}